e eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"true\" data-tab=\"1\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-controls=\"o-aplikaci-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >O aplikaci<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                            <li id=\"kompatibiln-pstroje\" class=\"inactive eael-tab-item-trigger eael-tab-nav-item\" aria-selected=\"false\" data-tab=\"2\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"kompatibiln-pstroje-tab\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                                                            <span class=\"eael-tab-title title-after-icon\" >Kompatibiln\u00ed p\u0159\u00edstroje<\/span>                                                    <\/li>\n                                    <\/ul>\n            <\/div>\n            \n            <div class=\"eael-tabs-content\">\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"o-aplikaci-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"o-aplikaci-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <p data-start=\"192\" data-end=\"459\">Modern\u00ed pivovarnictv\u00ed pot\u0159ebuje rychl\u00e1 a p\u0159esn\u00e1 data. Ve spolupr\u00e1ci s V\u00fdzkumn\u00fdm \u00fastavem pivovarsk\u00fdm a slada\u0159sk\u00fdm (V\u00daPS) jsme vyvinuli \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed, kter\u00e9 umo\u017en\u00ed komplexn\u00ed anal\u00fdzu piva b\u011bhem <strong data-start=\"376\" data-end=\"387\">3 minut<\/strong> \u2014 <strong data-start=\"390\" data-end=\"414\">na jedin\u00e9m p\u0159\u00edstroji<\/strong>, <strong data-start=\"416\" data-end=\"458\">bez pot\u0159eby specializovan\u00e9ho person\u00e1lu<\/strong>: spojili jsme <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/modelova-rada\/ftir-spektroskopie\/\"><strong>FT-IR spektrometry Nicolet<\/strong><\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/autosampler-salsa\/\"><strong>autosampler SALSA<\/strong><\/a> a syst\u00e9m IBIS.<\/p><h3 data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"507\">Co p\u0159in\u00e1\u0161\u00ed kombinace FT-IR Nicolet + SALSA + IBIS:<\/h3><ul><li data-start=\"510\" data-end=\"544\">V\u0161echny kl\u00ed\u010dov\u00e9 parametry najednou<\/li><li data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"589\">Rychl\u00e1 anal\u00fdza bez slo\u017eit\u00e9 p\u0159\u00edpravy vzorku<\/li><li data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"628\">Mo\u017enost m\u011b\u0159it v jak\u00e9koli f\u00e1zi v\u00fdroby<\/li><li data-start=\"631\" data-end=\"665\">Optimalizace v\u00fdroby v re\u00e1ln\u00e9m \u010dase<\/li><\/ul><h2 data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"696\">Analyzovan\u00e9 parametry<\/h2><p data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"921\">Syst\u00e9m IBIS je zalo\u017een\u00fd na <strong data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"746\">um\u011bl\u00e9 inteligenci<\/strong>, tr\u00e9novan\u00e9 na v\u00edce ne\u017e <strong data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"804\">3500 vzorc\u00edch z 170 druh\u016f piva<\/strong>. Um\u00ed analyzovat nejen z\u00e1kladn\u00ed chemick\u00e9 parametry, ale tak\u00e9 <strong data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"888\">hodnotit senzorick\u00e9 vlastnosti<\/strong> a <strong data-start=\"891\" data-end=\"920\">p\u0159edpov\u00eddat st\u00e1rnut\u00ed piva<\/strong>.<\/p><figure id=\"attachment_12167\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-12167\" style=\"width: 500px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-12167\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/04\/ad073196-300x88.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"146\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/04\/ad073196-300x88.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/04\/ad073196-1024x299.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/04\/ad073196-768x224.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/04\/ad073196-1536x449.png 1536w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2024\/04\/ad073196.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-12167\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">FT-IR spektrometr Nicolet ve spojen\u00ed s autosamplerem SALSA<\/figcaption><\/figure><p data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"959\">\u00a0<\/p><p data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"959\"><strong data-start=\"923\" data-end=\"959\">Chemick\u00e9 a senzorick\u00e9 ukazatele:<\/strong><\/p><ul><li data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"1000\">Obsah alkoholu (hmotnostn\u00ed \/ objemov\u00fd)<\/li><li data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1026\">Extrakt p\u016fvodn\u00ed mladiny<\/li><li data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1069\">Skute\u010dn\u00fd, zd\u00e1nliv\u00fd a dosa\u017eiteln\u00fd extrakt<\/li><li data-start=\"1072\" data-end=\"1082\">Prokva\u0161en\u00ed<\/li><li data-start=\"1085\" data-end=\"1092\">pH, IBU<\/li><li data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1132\">Polyfenoly, tanoidy, voln\u00fd aminodus\u00edk<\/li><li data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1149\">Stabilita p\u011bny<\/li><li data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1246\">N\u00e1chylnost ke st\u00e1rnut\u00ed a jeho senzorick\u00e9 projevy (medovitost, pap\u00edrovitost, kovov\u00e1 pachu\u0165 aj.)<\/li><\/ul><h2 data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1280\">IBIS vs. klasick\u00e9 metody<\/h2><div class=\"_tableContainer_16hzy_1\"><div class=\"_tableWrapper_16hzy_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\"><table class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\" data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1655\"><thead data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1341\"><tr data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1341\"><th data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1306\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1284\" data-end=\"1305\">Referen\u010dn\u00ed metody<\/strong><\/th><th data-start=\"1306\" data-end=\"1341\" data-col-size=\"sm\"><strong data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1339\">Syst\u00e9m IBIS + FT-IR Nicolet<\/strong><\/th><\/tr><\/thead><tbody data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1655\"><tr data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1451\"><td data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1428\" data-col-size=\"sm\">V\u00fdsledky za 6\u20139 m\u011bs\u00edc\u016f<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1428\" data-end=\"1451\">V\u00fdsledky do 3 minut<\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1502\"><td data-start=\"1452\" data-end=\"1477\" data-col-size=\"sm\">A\u017e 7 r\u016fzn\u00fdch p\u0159\u00edstroj\u016f<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1502\">1 p\u0159\u00edstroj na v\u0161echno<\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1547\"><td data-start=\"1503\" data-end=\"1521\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Vysoce n\u00e1kladn\u00e9<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1521\" data-end=\"1547\">N\u00edzk\u00e9 provozn\u00ed n\u00e1klady<\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1602\"><td data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1580\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Nutnost vy\u0161kolen\u00e9ho person\u00e1lu<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1602\">Intuitivn\u00ed obsluha<\/td><\/tr><tr data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1655\"><td data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1630\" data-col-size=\"sm\">\u010cas anal\u00fdzy: a\u017e 55 hodin<\/td><td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1655\">\u010cas anal\u00fdzy: 3 minuty<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/div><\/div>                    <\/div>\n\t\t        \n                    <div id=\"kompatibiln-pstroje-tab\" class=\"clearfix eael-tab-content-item inactive\" data-title-link=\"kompatibiln-pstroje-tab\">\n\t\t\t\t        <style>@media(max-width:1024px){.elementor-5032 .elementor-element.elementor-element-43f4b2a9 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 20px 0px;}}@media(max-width:767px){.elementor-5032 .elementor-element.elementor-element-43f4b2a9 .dce-post-item{padding:0px 0px 15px 0px;}}<\/style>\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"section\" data-elementor-id=\"5032\" class=\"elementor elementor-5032\" data-elementor-post-type=\"elementor_library\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elemen